<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Template of THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.html for cargo-about (configuration: packaging/about.toml).
  The workspace's own crates (no `source`) are left out of the lists. The fonts of egui and the
  icon font come with their copyright lines from the fonts themselves (name table); their
  licence texts follow below with the crates epaint_default_fonts and egui-phosphor, except the
  one of Phosphor, which that crate does not ship.
-->
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Driftless – Lizenzen Dritter</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; padding: 0 16px; }
  main { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0 48px; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2em; padding-bottom: 0.2em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.4); }
  h3 { margin: 1.6em 0 0.3em; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: 4px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.3); }
  ul.crates { margin: 0.3em 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .who { opacity: 0.7; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 0.85em; margin: 0.6em 0; padding: 8px 12px; max-height: 24em; overflow: auto;
        border-left: 3px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.5); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Driftless – Lizenzen Dritter</h1>
<p>Driftless enthält Programmteile anderer Autoren: Rust-Bibliotheken und Schriften. Sie stehen unter
den Lizenzen, deren Texte hier folgen; unter jeder Überschrift steht, welche Bibliotheken diesen Text
verwenden.</p>
<p>Driftless selbst steht nach Wahl unter der Apache-Lizenz 2.0 oder der MIT-Lizenz (Apache-2.0 OR MIT),
ebenso das Programmsymbol, das zu Driftless gehört.</p>

<h2 id="schriften">Schriften und Symbole</h2>
<p>Diese Schriften sind in das Programm eingebettet:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Schrift</th><th>Rechte</th><th>Lizenz</th></tr>
<tr><td>Hack (aus epaint_default_fonts)</td>
    <td>Copyright (c) 2018 Source Foundry Authors; Bitstream Vera Sans Mono: Copyright (c) 2003 by Bitstream, Inc.</td>
    <td>MIT und Bitstream-Vera-Lizenz (Text unter MIT, epaint_default_fonts)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Noto Emoji (aus epaint_default_fonts)</td>
    <td>Copyright 2013 Google Inc.</td>
    <td>SIL Open Font License 1.1</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ubuntu Light (aus epaint_default_fonts)</td>
    <td>Copyright 2011 Canonical Ltd.</td>
    <td>Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0</td></tr>
<tr><td>emoji-icon-font (aus epaint_default_fonts)</td>
    <td>Copyright (c) 2014 John Slegers</td>
    <td>MIT</td></tr>
<tr><td>Phosphor Icons, die Symbole der Oberfläche (aus egui-phosphor)</td>
    <td>Copyright (c) 2020 Phosphor Icons</td>
    <td>MIT, Text hier:</td></tr>
</table>
